# Traducción de link-p2p al español
# Compilar: msgfmt --check -o link-p2p.mo link-p2p.po
# Los placeholders {0}, {1} son estilo format! de Rust; conserva su orden al traducir.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: link-p2p 0.1.0\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: es_ES\n"

# --- Ayuda de línea de comandos ---

msgid "Minimal TCP-over-QUIC forwarder on iroh"
msgstr "Reenviador TCP-over-QUIC mínimo sobre iroh"

msgid ""
"link-p2p exposes a local TCP service to a P2P network (or dials one) over a "
"direct, end-to-end encrypted QUIC connection. No TUN device, no "
"root/admin privileges — just a persistent EndpointId and a QUIC hop."
msgstr ""
"link-p2p expone un servicio TCP local a una red P2P (o se conecta a uno) mediante "
"una conexión QUIC directa cifrada de extremo a extremo. Sin dispositivo TUN, "
"sin privilegios de root/administrador: solo un EndpointId persistente y un salto QUIC."

msgid ""
"QUICK START:\n"
"    # On the machine you want to expose (e.g. its SSH server):\n"
"    link-p2p serve --forward 127.0.0.1:22\n"
"    # -> prints an EndpointId, share it with the other side\n"
"\n"
"    # On the connecting machine:\n"
"    link-p2p connect --to <EndpointId> --listen 127.0.0.1:2222\n"
"    ssh -p 2222 localhost\n"
"\n"
"SHELL COMPLETIONS:\n"
"    link-p2p completions fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/link-p2p.fish\n"
"    link-p2p completions bash > /etc/bash_completion.d/link-p2p\n"
"\n"
"See README.md for self-hosted --relay setup and benchmarking against "
"WireGuard/Tailscale."
msgstr ""
"INICIO RÁPIDO:\n"
"    # En la máquina que quieres exponer (p. ej. su servidor SSH):\n"
"    link-p2p serve --forward 127.0.0.1:22\n"
"    # -> imprime un EndpointId, compártelo con el otro lado\n"
"\n"
"    # En la máquina que se conecta:\n"
"    link-p2p connect --to <EndpointId> --listen 127.0.0.1:2222\n"
"    ssh -p 2222 localhost\n"
"\n"
"COMPLETADO DE SHELL:\n"
"    link-p2p completions fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/link-p2p.fish\n"
"    link-p2p completions bash > /etc/bash_completion.d/link-p2p\n"
"\n"
"Consulta README.md para el relay autoalojado (--relay) y la comparación con WireGuard/Tailscale."

msgid ""
"Path to store/load this node's persistent secret key. If it doesn't exist "
"yet, a new one is generated and saved there. Default: the XDG config dir, "
"$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/link-p2p/identity.key (usually ~/.config/link-p2p/"
"identity.key); a legacy ./identity.key in the working directory is migrated "
"there once. Keep this stable if you want your EndpointId to stay the same "
"across restarts."
msgstr ""
"Ruta para guardar/cargar la clave secreta persistente de este nodo. Si no existe, "
"se genera una nueva y se guarda aquí. Predeterminado: el directorio de configuración "
"XDG, $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/link-p2p/identity.key (normalmente ~/.config/link-p2p/identity.key); "
"un identity.key heredado (./identity.key) en el directorio de trabajo se migra allí una vez. "
"Mantén este archivo estable para que tu EndpointId no cambie entre reinicios."

msgid ""
"Use a custom relay server instead of n0's public one, e.g. http://127.0.0.1:3340 "
"(run `iroh-relay --dev` locally). With this set, address discovery is skipped "
"entirely: `connect` dials the peer directly through this relay, so no DNS/pkarr "
"lookup to iroh.link is needed. Useful for self-hosted relays and for "
"offline/local testing."
msgstr ""
"Usa un servidor relay propio en lugar del público de n0, p. ej. http://127.0.0.1:3340 "
"(ejecuta `iroh-relay --dev` localmente). Con esto se omite por completo el "
"descubrimiento de direcciones: `connect` dial al peer directamente a través de este "
"relay, sin necesidad de consultar DNS/pkarr a iroh.link. Útil para relays "
"autoalojados y pruebas offline/locales."

msgid "Expose a local TCP service to the P2P network."
msgstr "Expone un servicio TCP local a la red P2P."

msgid "Local address to forward incoming P2P streams to, e.g. 127.0.0.1:8080"
msgstr "Dirección local a la que reenviar los streams P2P entrantes, p. ej. 127.0.0.1:8080"

msgid "Dial a remote node and expose it as a local TCP listener."
msgstr "Marca a un nodo remoto y expónlo como un listener TCP local."

msgid "The remote node's EndpointId (printed by `serve` on startup)"
msgstr "El EndpointId del nodo remoto (impreso por `serve` al arrancar)"

msgid "Local address to listen on, e.g. 127.0.0.1:9090"
msgstr "Dirección local donde escuchar, p. ej. 127.0.0.1:9090"

msgid "Print a shell completion script to stdout."
msgstr "Imprime un script de completado de shell en stdout."

msgid ""
"Print a shell completion script to stdout.\n"
"\n"
"Redirect it to wherever your shell loads completions from, e.g. `link-p2p "
"completions fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/link-p2p.fish`."
msgstr ""
"Imprime un script de completado de shell en stdout.\n"
"\n"
"Redirígelo a donde tu shell cargue los completados, p. ej. `link-p2p completions "
"fish > ~/.config/fish/completions/link-p2p.fish`."

msgid "Which shell to generate a completion script for."
msgstr "Para qué shell generar el script de completado."

msgid "Control colored output: auto (colors on TTY only), always, or never."
msgstr "Controla la salida con colores: auto (colores solo en TTY), always o never."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of concurrent forwarded connections. 0 means unlimited. "
"Prevents resource exhaustion on endpoints exposed to the network."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de conexiones reenviadas simultáneamente. 0 significa ilimitado. "
"Evita el agotamiento de recursos en endpoints expuestos a la red."

